		<Server Name="ProfileError" GUID="{07832EB3-E99C-437C-93E6-E4EBB2D9829D}" Visualized="true" Initialize="false" WriteProtected="true" Retentive="false" Comment="Errormessages:&#13;&#10;=======================================================================================================================================&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_NoError              - No error occured&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_INIT_ERROR           - Not enough memory for the profile buffer&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_MOVECMD_ERROR        - Unknown move command&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_INT_POINTER_ERROR    - Internal pointer error&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_JUMP_CMD_ERROR       - After a jump active command there is no active entry in the buffer&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_POS_OVERRUN_ERROR    - Set position overrun&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_AXIS_ERROR           - One of the coupled axes has an error&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_SWE_ERROR            - SW end position violation while loading the command&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_CIRDEF_ERROR         - The circle definition is wrong&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_NO_POS_CHANGE        - Move command without any axes travel&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_GROUP_ERROR          - Change Command to this Group is not possible because the Set Group has no Distance / SubError: Set GroupNr&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_KOFAC_ERROR          - Division error in the calculation of the coupling factors / Sub error shows the axis number&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_VEL_CMD_ERROR        - Movement speed &lt; 1&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_ACC_CMD_ERROR        - Movement acceleration / deceleration &lt; 1&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_JERK_CMD_ERROR       - Movement jerk &lt; 1&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_RESOLUTION_ERROR     - Error occured while loading the command,the entries are bigger than 2^31 when multiplied by the resolution factor.&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_SAFETY_ZONES_REACHED - User has reached a safety zone&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_INSERT_ERROR         - The profile buffer is full&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_AXIS_NOT_CONNECTED   - Selected axis was not found or is not connected&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_GROUP_NOT_FOUND      - Selected group is not configured in the system&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_PARAMETER_NOT_FOUND  - Selected parameter was not found in the settings&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_PARAMETER_ERROR      - Enable/disable of the selected function is impossible&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_ERROR_BUSY           - Changeing a parameter is not allowed in this mode&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_OUT_OF_RANGE         - Set value was too big or too small&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_RADIUS_ERROR         - Circle radius is out of range (radius &gt; 2^31 - 1 [internal units]).&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_ARCLEN_ERROR         - Circle arc length is out of range (arc length &gt; 2^31 - 1 [internal units]).&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_RES_PATHLEN_ERROR    - The residual path length is out of range (residual path length &gt; 2^31 - 1 [internal units]).&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_ENDPOS_ERROR       - The end position of a move is out of range (end position &gt; 2^31 - 1 [Internal units]).&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_AXTRAVEL_ERROR       - The axis travel distance is out of range (end position - start position &gt; 2^31 - 1 [Internal units]).&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_AX_COUPLE_ERROR      - Some axis coupling command (CoupleGearAbsolute etc.) returned an error.&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_PLAINEDEF_ERROR      - The Plaine of the Circle is not defined&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_VEC_ERROR       - Coordinates of Vecotrs used for Calcualtion of a Circle are out of Range&#13;&#10;_LMCPROF_LOCKGROUP_ERROR      - Slave-Group of an Axis is undefined.&#13;&#10;"/>
		<Server Name="ProfileStatus" GUID="{E057A4C3-5546-4C75-BBC3-9962453C9B57}" Visualized="true" Initialize="false" WriteProtected="true" Retentive="false" Comment="bit field displaying various information about the profile state"/>
		<Server Name="ResidualPath" GUID="{59F4AC50-1674-4403-B5FB-86361EF27BDF}" Visualized="true" Initialize="false" WriteProtected="true" Retentive="false" Comment="Residual path is the sum of all loaded path length minus &#13;&#10;the distance travelled so far."/>
		<Server Name="Resolution" GUID="{9AEB3D1A-07D8-4EE6-BA95-4809B3656348}" Visualized="true" Initialize="true" DefValue="1" WriteProtected="true" Retentive="false" Comment="The resolution factor, which is applied to position, speed and acceleration values, is read over this server.&#13;&#10;All inputs are internally multiplied with this resolution factor. The LMCProfile class and the connected LMCAxis objects must have the same resolution factor.&#13;&#10;This server must be initialized."/>
		<Server Name="Start" GUID="{D7035C4C-EFD0-4473-8E26-0723D6AC757B}" Visualized="true" Initialize="false" WriteProtected="false" Retentive="false" Comment="An input of &quot;1&quot; into this server initiates the movement. &#13;&#10;If a point is approached, whereby the speed of all axes is zero, a new start command must be sent.&#13;&#10;The type of the next move command is shown on the server ActCmd, the index of the command on server ActCmdNo.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;This server is active in manual mode only."/>
